# A toggle in GMS, worth an elemental resistance nothing here uses. What is left
# is the damage reduction, which the magician has all the time instead of only
# while the aura is up.
#
# Its freeze is dropped on purpose. GMS only says the aura "freezes up to 15
# enemies periodically", and the client gives no interval; the branch's own Cold
# Beam already freezes for eight seconds from a swing under a second, so
# everything the book gains from frozen enemies is already there.
#
# Status resistance is kept but never used: nothing inflicts a status. It is
# here to keep the wiki's figure with its skill.
name: "Absolute Zero Aura"
description: "Envelops you and nearby party members in a shield of cold."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_WIZARD skill_order: 4 }
max_level: 10
base {
  damage_taken_pct: 0.02
  status_resistance: 2
}
per_level {
  damage_taken_pct: 0.02
  status_resistance: 2
}
ally_base {
  damage_taken_pct: 0.02
  status_resistance: 2
}
ally_per_level {
  damage_taken_pct: 0.02
  status_resistance: 2
}
